This long-tier segment ships its run manifest only.

`basalt_traj.csv` (3.4 MB) and `frames.sha256` (3.6 MB) are too
large to check in and come from the reference bundle instead: point
SLAM_RS_REFERENCE_DIR at a copy, or drop it in packages/slam-rs/data/reference/,
laid out as <segment>/basalt_traj.csv. `slam_rs.reference_bundle` resolves them
and the tests skip with a clear message when they are absent.

run.json here carries the full provenance, including the trajectory's own
sha256, so a bundle copy can be verified against it.
